      <li><strong>OpenRouter vs Gemini:</strong> I utilized Gemini 3 Pro (per instructions for high-quality reasoning) but the architecture is modular for OpenRouter.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Volume:</strong> How many files do you expect? Gemini 3 supports 2M+ tokens, perfect for large folders.</li>
